        |由于天资使然，萤从来都不是一个最冷静沉着的人，而如今她怀孕了，这种情绪波动更是加剧了。但当她将怀孕的身体紧贴在你身上时，她身上那种紧张与颤抖便会随之缓解。
        |这种感觉很尴尬，就好像她在宣称你[pc.ra kitsune
            |尽管你们的地位存在着巨大的差距
            |归她所有
        ]，但萤此刻明显愉悦的心情，压下了所有进一步的疑问。
    ]
]。 [hotaru.anyKids
    |一旦你走出家门，就会先短暂地停一下，去萤的妈妈那里把香织送过去，然后就可以去泡澡了。
]

rows.original:
Mai doesn't take much convincing[dayNight
    | to get out of bed
    |, even if she's on her shift at the shrine
] — no sooner has she heard your explanation that the shrine maiden fetches her things and [mai.isPregnant
    |waddles
    |hurries
] up to the tree's branches. [party.has kiyoko
    |[kiyoko.married
        |Your fox wife
        |Kiyoko
    ]'s still grumpily holding down the fort outside Hotaru's door, and acknowledges Mai's arrival with a curt nod;
    |Nothing's changed since you left; if anything, the silence from within is eerily disquieting considering what's going on behind those doors. 
] Mai sets down her things, takes a deep breath, and calls out to Hotaru in her native tongue; Hotaru replies with a stream of ear-scouring invective that carries its intent well enough despite the exact words being lost on you.

"Well, [pc.ra kitsune
    |yer Eminence, 
]I don't think I should be translatin' what she said none. But it ain't a bad idea to jus' leave her be if'n there ain't no trouble." Mai sets down her things, leans against the wall and sighs. "[mai.sober
    |I kinda done get how she feels, ya know? Even now, 's one of them times I wish I could still have a smoke.
    |I — damn it, lil' ol' me done forgot to bring my <b>kiseru</b>. I could use a smoke right 'bout now.
]

"If'n there's actual trouble, I'm goin' in whether she wants it or not. But otherwise... Hotaru don't want folks gawking at her while she does the deed. An'... lil' ol' me can respect that, so long as she's safe."

If you remember her words right, she just wanted to crawl into a dark place by herself, get it done, and face the world when she's good and ready.

"Jus' so[pc.ra kitsune
    |, yer Eminence
].[hotaru.isMILF
    | Guess 's a bit of a touch an' go — Hotaru were already wide an' takin' all that there sap done made her even more so, to the point where I shouldn't be worried 'bout her none. But the kit in her also grew to match, so I ain't restin' easy jus' yet.
]"

Moments pass as the [party.has kiyoko
    |three
    |both
] of you settle down to wait; Mai helps herself to Hotaru's tea set and brews some. The air turns heavy and oppressive; the only sign of life from within Hotaru's sleeping chambers the occasional muffled thump. [party.has kiyoko
    |[kiyoko.married
        |Your fox-wife
        |Kiyoko
    ]
    |Mai
] tries to make some light conversation to ease the tension, but it's clear her heart isn't in it.

"Normally, I wouldn't be waitin' outside the door nohow," Mai mutters as she stares into her steaming teacup[mai.sober
    |
    |, no doubt wishing she could light up a pipe right about now
]. "But like Miko an' me, ain't much ever right with Hotaru. When ya done find a place to dump all them cursed an' gifted folks out of sight —"

Suddenly, Mai's ears twitch, and she stops. [pc.ra kitsune
    |Yours are quick to pick up on the sense of disquietment
    |You feel it in the pit of your stomach
], too, and as your eyes turn to the sliding door tongues of blue-white flame creep out from under and around it. No smoke, no heat that [party.has kiyoko
    |any
    |either
] of you can feel at this distance, but now that your attention's been drawn to it, dancing lights flicker behind the paper and wood like the backdrop of a puppet show, calling to you.

rows.translation:
    舞并不需要太多的说服才能被说服。[dayNight
        | 从床上起来
        |即使她正在神社值班也是如此。
    ] — 她刚听完你的解释，那位神社少女就立刻拿起了她的东西离开了。 [mai.isPregnant
        |摇摇摆摆地走
        |匆忙行事
    ]高到了树的树枝上。 [party.has kiyoko
        |[kiyoko.married
            |你的狐狸妻子
