rows.original:
Kaori... the name sounds faintly familiar. Did Hotaru mention having settled on a name for your daughter prior? Well, since you weren't around, she certainly had the prerogative to pick one out.

"It roughly translates to 'fragrance of fire', and it should be obvious why." Hotaru leans in dangerously close, her free hand reaching [pc.heightRange 70
    |up 
] for your shoulders, [pc.heightRange 70
    |pulling herself close such that her nose's
    |her nose
] right up against to yours. "More of a name than mine, and far more meaningful. Look at your daughter — [pc.ra kitsune
    |more than worthy of a divine champion's lineage. Don't be so indecisive — it's unbecoming of someone with your position.
    |it's obvious that I've spared no expense in making good use of the opportunity you've given me, isn't it?
]"

rows.translation:
香织……这个名字听起来似乎有点熟悉。萤之前有没有提到过已经为你的女儿选好了名字呢？嗯，既然你当时不在场，她当然有权利自己挑一个。

“这个名字大致意思是‘火焰的芬芳’，原因应该很明显吧。”萤凑得非常近，她的另一只手伸了过来[pc.heightRange 70
    |向上 
]为了够到你的肩膀， [pc.heightRange 70
    |她把身体拉近了一些，以至于她的鼻子……
    |她的鼻子
]鼻尖几乎要贴到你的鼻子上了。“一个比我更像名字的名字，而且意义也深远得多。看看你的女儿—— [pc.ra kitsune
    |完全配得上成为一位神圣冠军的后裔。别这么优柔寡断，这样的态度与你的地位极不相称。
    |很明显，我充分利用了你给予我的这个机会，没有浪费任何资源，对吧？
]”

rows.original:
So... what happens now? And what about her parents?

Hotaru doesn't answer at first, instead turning her gaze between Kaori in her arms and you. "Well... I'm still working on cleaning up all the scorch marks and replacing all the furniture that was, uh, damaged during the birth. That much is clear[pc.ra kitsune
    |, my [pc.mf
        |lord
        |lady
    ]
]. Afterwards, I guess we continue living our lives, ha. [kohaku.anyKids
    |Kohaku keeps on moaning about how her kit is a mischievous brat 
    |You keep on hearing things about how children are a handful
], Kaori's been nothing but obliging ever since she came out of me. If all my children are going to be — ah, humorless sticks in the mud, as Kohaku puts it, the prospect of having several more in a few years, maybe under more stable conditions, doesn't sound so bad.

"But for now? I'll bask in the attention while it lasts. These last several months have proven that I've done well enough for myself,[pc.ra kitsune
    | my [pc.mf
        |lord
        |lady
    ],
] and intend to continue doing so. If you're concerned for my welfare, I wouldn't have started this if I didn't have a plan to see it through, so don't worry. That, and there are others looking out for me. Despite having another soul to feed, I'm actually feeling hungry <b>less</b> often than before. No idea why, but it suits a homebody like me just fine."

That's... well. You knew that someone as meticulous as Hotaru — while she's not being gifted, anyway — would've have this all planned out, but hearing it from her with such confidence does put you at ease. And of the people that inspired all this to begin with...?

"As for my parents, they haven't made it back all the way; traveling across the continent takes time, even for them. Nevertheless, last I heard they were almost upon the Marches, so I'd expect them soon. I'm sure they'll have something to say to a new grandchild[pc.ra kitsune
    |, especially one that's the get of a divine champion
]. Ha."

rows.translation:
那么……现在会发生什么呢？她的父母又该怎么办呢？

初音一开始并没有回答，而是将目光在怀中的香织和你之间来回移动。“嗯……我还在忙着清理那些烧焦的痕迹，以及更换那些在分娩过程中被损坏的家具。这些事情目前还挺麻烦的。[pc.ra kitsune
    |我的[pc.mf
        |领主
        |女士
    ]
]之后，我想我们还是继续过自己的生活吧，哈哈。 [kohaku.anyKids
    |小白一直抱怨说，她的技能组合简直就像个调皮捣蛋的小鬼。 
    |你总是听到各种说法，说孩子们真是让人头疼。
]自从香织从我体内诞生以来，她一直都是那么顺从、听话。如果我的所有孩子都像琥珀说的那样，变成毫无幽默感、死板刻板的人，那么再过几年，在更加稳定的环境中再要几个孩子，其实也不是什么坏事。

“不过现在嘛？我会好好享受这段被人关注的时光。过去这几个月已经证明，我确实为自己做得够好了。[pc.ra kitsune
    | 我的[pc.mf
        |领主
        |女士
    ]，
]并且我也有继续这样做的打算。如果你真的关心我的安危，那么如果我没有完成这个计划的打算，就不会开始这样做，所以请不要担心。另外，还有其他人也在照顾我。尽管现在还要养活另一个人，但实际上我并没有感到饿。<b>较少</b>比以前更频繁了。虽然不知道为什么，但这种生活方式其实很适合我这样的内向人士。”

嗯……你本来就知道，像萤这样一丝不苟的人——虽然她的天赋并不出众——肯定会把这一切都安排得井井有条。但听到她如此自信地这么说，确实让人感到安心。而那些最初激发了我这一切想法的人们……呢？

“至于我的父母，他们还没有完全回来；即使对他们来说，横跨整个大陆也需要时间。不过，据我最后一次得到的消息，他们应该已经快到边境地区了，所以应该很快就会回来吧。我敢肯定，他们肯定会有话要对这个新出生的孙子或孙女说。[pc.ra kitsune
    |尤其是那种由神圣英雄所诞生的存在。
]哈。

rows.original:
A moment of silence, and then Hotaaru squares her shoulders and looks you in the eye. "I know this is awkward, and [pc.ra kitsune
    |we 
]kitsune are infamous for being roundabout in our words, so I think it's best if I make this clear[pc.ra kitsune
    |, your Eminence
]. We had an agreement, and it is concluded. You don't owe me anything else, nor do you have to involve yourself further if [pc.ra kitsune
    |your duties keep you away
    |you'd rather not get involved in the tangled webs we weave
]... but if you do, I can make it worth your time. With the need out of the way, you know that if we're together, it'll be because of desire. And isn't that far more gratifying?"

[pc.ra kitsune
    |Oh, no. While you still have some things to learn about the tangled webs foxes weave, you're more than aware this is a I-want-it-but-I'm-not-going-to-say-I-want-it thing
    |She doesn't have to play coy with you — not having to play at social niceties is one of the privileges not being a fox affords you. If she wants it, she's more than welcome to say so
]. And as it just so happens, you've come to see her, so you can get started this very moment.

"That would make both Kaori and me very happy[pc.ra kitsune
    |, my [pc.mf
        |lord
        |lady
    ]
    | indeed
]. Please, come in." Beyond herself with smugness at how well all this went, Hotaru leads you into her home, tails swaying all the while — [hotaru.isMILF
    |her fur's become a lot glossier from how you remember it being, and there's an obvious spring in the seamstress' step as she ushers you in. Obviously the considerable degree by which her hips and rear have widened with feminine grace is a part of it
    |and everything attached to said tails, too. Part of it is the weight she's obviously put on between then and now
], but she's also a lot more confident than you remember her being as she seats the both of you at the low table and hugs Kaori to herself. "Shall we have a little family time, then?"

rows.translation:
片刻的沉默之后，Hotaaru挺直肩膀，直视着你的眼睛说道：“我知道这样有点尴尬，但是[pc.ra kitsune
    |我们 
]狐妖以说话拐弯抹角而闻名，所以我觉得最好把这一点说得清楚些。[pc.ra kitsune
    |，阁下
]我们之前有过约定，而且那个约定也已经履行完毕了。你不再欠我任何东西，也不需要再继续介入这件事了。 [pc.ra kitsune
    |工作太忙，无暇顾及其他事情。
    |你最好别卷入我们编织的这些错综复杂的麻烦中。
]……但如果你愿意，我可以让这一切都值得你的时间。既然需求已经得到满足，你知道，如果我们在一起，那一定是出于彼此的意愿。这样不是会让人感到更加满足吗？

[pc.ra kitsune
    |哦，不。虽然你还有很多关于狐狸们编织的错综复杂的网状关系需要去了解，但你心里很清楚，这其实就是那种“我想要，但又不敢说出来”的情况。
    |她没有必要对你故作矜持——不必拘泥于社交礼仪，正是身为“非狐狸”所能享有的特权之一。如果她想要什么，她完全可以直接说出来。
]正好你今天来见了她，所以你可以立刻开始行动了。

“这样的话，我和香织都会非常开心的。[pc.ra kitsune
    |我的[pc.mf
        |领主
        |女士
    ]
    | 确实如此。
]请进来吧。” 萤满心得意地领着你走进她的家，她的尾巴一路上都在摇来摇去[hotaru.isMILF
    |与你记忆中的样子相比，它的毛皮变得亮泽了许多；而那位裁缝在带你进去时，步履中也明显带着一种轻盈活泼的神情。显然，她的臀部以及整个身形都变得更加圆润、富有女性魅力，这也是原因之一。
    |还有那些附着在尾巴上的所有东西。其中一部分原因，显然就是从那以后到现在，她的体重增加了。
]但她现在比你记忆中的要自信得多。她让你们俩坐在那张矮桌旁，然后把薰抱在怀里。“那么，我们是不是应该花点时间来享受一下家庭时光呢？

rows.original:
[pc.ra kitsune
