"Some time ago, I taught her the basics of swordplay. She wasn't very interested in it, yet she surprised me with how open-minded her approach was. She tried to understand what the mentality behind fighting is... heh, not an easy thing to do. You can ask two different battle masters what fighting means and they'll give you two radically different answers. It might not look like it, but Rindo is indeed a warrior; she doesn’t fight with swords, but to understand what her place in the world is. She’s intelligent and insightful, strong enough to not let her incident decide who she is. Pushing through adversities like this is what I think qualifies as true strength. [rindo.isConcubine
    |"You know, she’s much happier now that she's your concubine. The thing Rindo needed the most was someone like you. She's safe from the political aspect too[pc.isKitsune
